#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0897 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "PLAN-dynamic-column-corpus-respelling S4 member-only scenario: besides TRT01A (a different value; with no APERIOD and one TRTxxA the record is compared with it, so that leg does not silence the rule) ADSL carries TRTAG1, a member of the one-digit TRTAGy family (find_vars(\"ADSL.TRTAGy\")). TRTA equals it, so the rule is silenced by that leg alone; a find_vars literal that missed the family would fire here."
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTA type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Drug X
---

dataset ADSL label="Subject-Level Analysis"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01A type=Char
col TRTAG1 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Placebo | Drug X
---
